WEBVTT

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:08.090
<i>We never managed to find any leads.</i>

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.240
<i>Where are you, Keith?</i>

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:16.740
<b>Doom</b>

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:40.560
<b>m 0 0 l 0 -7 b 7 -7 15 -15 15 -29 l 30 -30 l 29 -15 b 15 -15 7 -7 7 0 b 7 7 15 15 29 15 l 30 30 l 15 29 b 15 15 7 7 0 7 b -7 7 -15 15 -15 29 l -30 30 l -29 15 b -15 15 -7 7 -7 0 b -7 -7 -15 -15 -29 -15 l -30 -30 l -15 -29 b -15 -15 -7 -7 0 -7</b>

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:40.560
<b>My Next Life as a Villainess: 
All Routes Lead to Doom!</b>

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:48.500
<b>Episode 10
Keith Disappeared... Part 2</b>

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.750
We'll spend the night in this town.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:48.360
Let's try that inn there.

00:01:57.500 --> 00:01:59.400
This looks so cool!

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:03.230
Cool? Um...

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:05.500
What sort of tool is it?

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:06.940
No idea!

00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:09.590
But doesn't it look really cool?

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:15.730
Here you go.

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:17.890
For you.

00:02:17.890 --> 00:02:20.350
Um... Are you sure?

00:02:20.350 --> 00:02:23.980
You've given me so many presents already...

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:26.560
Well, we're engaged, after all.

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:28.530
You know, Catarina...

00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:32.840
You seem to have forgotten since Keith
is the only thing on your mind now,

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:35.100
but as I told you before, I—

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:36.210
There.

00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:39.410
I noticed you two were nowhere to be found.

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:41.600
So this is where you've been.

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:44.060
Sora, did you do this on purpose?

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:45.700
I was asked to.

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:46.720
Asked to?

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:47.520
Yes.

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:52.100
A certain someone made a formal 
request through the Department of Magic,

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:56.300
asking that I assure Lady Catarina's safety.

00:02:57.310 --> 00:03:01.710
And does that include getting in my way?

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:04.490
That's the main objective, in fact.

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:07.210
This really is so cool!

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:10.200
Thank you, Prince Geordo!

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:18.880
It all looks delicious!

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.910
Let's eat!

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:28.070
<i>I need to eat a good meal tonight,</i>

00:03:28.070 --> 00:03:30.600
<i>so I can search for Keith tomorrow!</i>

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:34.810
I ate too much...

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:37.130
Are you all right, Lady Catarina?

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:38.900
Y-Yes...

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:47.380
<i>What's with that look? Cheeky little bear!</i>

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:50.200
<i>If Keith were here...</i>

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:54.310
<i>He would've mercilessly taken my plate
 away before this could happen.</i>

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:56.670
You're eating too much, Sister.

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:01.490
I'm going to go lie down.

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:16.200
Lady Catarina, does your 
stomach feel better now?

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:16.960
Yes...

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:17.850
Oh, good.

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:20.230
Hey, where's Lady Larna?

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:23.200
She said she had something 
to take care of and left.

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:24.570
Huh...

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:28.700
Isn't this little one adorable?

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:31.600
Wha—

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:34.120
<i>How infuriating!</i>

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:37.260
Oh, I'm sure you'd like 
to hold him, too, right?

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:39.330
Here.

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:47.010
I'm going to the bathroom.

00:04:57.200 --> 00:04:59.280
Wh-What's with your attitude?!

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:06.320
What is it?

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:08.140
I just feel so happy.

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:09.290
Happy?

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:14.760
Oh, I'm sorry for saying something like 
that when Keith is missing.

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:20.540
Ever since my magic power 
manifested, I had no friends at all,

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:26.020
so I still can't believe 
I'm here on a trip together with you.

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:29.720
We should do this again
when we have a chance.

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:31.090
With everyone next time.

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:32.260
Okay.

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:35.990
Um, Lady Catarina...

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:39.790
Before I met you,

00:05:39.790 --> 00:05:45.240
every night when I got into bed, 
I felt terribly lonely.

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:50.530
But now, I'm having so 
much fun, and I feel happy.

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:52.300
I'm glad to hear that.

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:57.530
So it's thanks to you 
that I am who I am now.

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:00.590
That's not true, Maria.

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:04.310
You're who you are 
because you worked so hard.

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:06.260
I haven't done anything.

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:09.700
Lady Catarina...

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:12.970
Please let me stay by your side forever.

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:15.470
Sure.

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:18.640
Goodnight.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:19.880
Goodnight.

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:31.850
Hello? Larna here.

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:33.610
Raphael, can you hear me?

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:35.870
<i>Yes, I can hear you.</i>

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:37.840
So it worked.

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:42.860
We can finally use this magic tool 
that works using wind magic.

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:44.090
How are things there?

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:45.930
How do you think they are?

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:49.840
You just dumped all your work on me 
and took off out of the blue.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:51.930
I wish you'd give me a break.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:54.700
<i>I know you can handle it 
without any trouble.</i>

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:56.200
<i>Have you found anything out?</i>

00:06:56.200 --> 00:06:59.030
Duke Claes is working on his own to search,

00:06:59.030 --> 00:07:01.810
but he doesn't seem 
to have found anything yet.

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:02.900
<i>I see.</i>

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:07.030
<i>Anyone who could outwit Duke 
Claes is a formidable foe.</i>

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:10.360
<i>And what of that other matter?</i>

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:13.220
I think we can be fairly certain.

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:16.700
I've actually found someone 
who seems to be involved.

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:21.300
Is there any connection 
to Keith Claes's disappearance?

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:23.120
<i>I'm not sure yet.</i>

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:25.770
Keep up the investigation, 
and leave no stone unturned.

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:28.840
I'm not convinced 
that there's no connection.

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:30.320
<i>Understood.</i>

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:34.060
<i>And, um... How is Lady Catarina?</i>

00:07:34.060 --> 00:07:37.770
She still believes Keith ran away from home.

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:39.470
I see.

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:43.870
Should we not fill her 
in on the information we have here?

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:46.090
Let's wait it out a bit longer.

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:49.630
All we have at the moment 
is still just speculation.

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:50.900
<i>Understood.</i>

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:57.290
<i>Please be safe, Keith Claes.</i>

00:07:57.590 --> 00:08:00.430
<i>For the sake of that pure 
older sister of yours, as well.</i>

00:08:18.380 --> 00:08:21.100
How are you all doing?

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:23.880
We haven't found Keith yet,

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:26.700
but I have faith that I'll see him soon.

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:29.980
I'm currently taking a break 
at a café in the town where we're staying.

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:36.680
Let's see... I got that present 
from Prince Geordo, and then...

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:39.120
Catarina, there's no need to write that.

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:42.280
I have a feeling it would make 
them all rush here in a panic.

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:43.340
Huh?

00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:50.960
I haven't seen these in so long!

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:53.290
Maybe not since my previous life!

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:54.550
What is it?

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:57.200
A plant seed that sticks to you.

00:08:57.980 --> 00:09:00.950
Wow, it really does stick.

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:03.400
What is this plant called?

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:06.020
Uh...

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:08.310
Sorry, I don't know the name.

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:12.300
<i>That face is totally saying,</i>

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:15.210
<i>"You brought it up and you don't 
even know what it's called?</i>

00:09:15.210 --> 00:09:16.570
<i>Then don't bring it up, idiot!"</i>

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:18.240
<i>Curse this bear!</i>

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:22.160
<i>I just had a great idea!</i>

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:27.150
I'm going out for a bit.

00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:29.930
See you later, Lady Larna.

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:49.530
Hah! Did that humble you 
a bit, you cheeky bear?

00:09:49.530 --> 00:09:54.720
That's what you get for constantly 
mocking the villainess Catarina!

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:03.660
What happened?

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:07.420
U-Um, I accidentally spilled those on him...

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:09.280
I see.

00:10:09.280 --> 00:10:11.380
Don't worry. I'll pull them off.

00:10:12.180 --> 00:10:13.710
<i>I lied...</i>

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:15.650
<i>Sorry, Maria.</i>

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:21.800
<i>I guess that was a childish thing 
to do to a teddy bear...</i>

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:24.970
<i>But he started it by making fun of me!</i>

00:10:26.300 --> 00:10:28.470
<i>I wish I could tell Keith about this.</i>

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:33.200
<i>Keith always listened when I told him 
about my day before going to sleep.</i>

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:36.320
<i>There's so much I want to tell him now.</i>

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:38.040
<i>Keith...</i>

00:10:39.040 --> 00:10:42.910
Keith, I miss you...

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:54.840
<i>How long has it been?</i>

00:10:55.520 --> 00:10:58.350
<i>What do they want to do with me?</i>

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:09.200
<i>Sister must be so worried...</i>

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:16.570
How are you feeling?

00:11:20.140 --> 00:11:24.580
If your eyes are still that focused, 
I guess you're still well.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:28.410
Most people would go crazy after 
being trapped in here for days

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:32.240
and subjected to constant beatings.

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:35.540
You truly are a worthy heir to Duke Claes.

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:39.230
Or is it just because you've been 
used to it since you were little?

00:11:39.230 --> 00:11:40.960
What is it you want?

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:43.060
Thomas asked me to do this.

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:45.930
He wants you to fall.

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.190
What does that mean?

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:52.430
He wants you to fall from the height of the 
duke's house to the lowest rung of society.

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:57.150
But Thomas says he can't wait any longer.

00:11:57.770 --> 00:12:02.770
It seems he can no longer bear those eyes 
of yours that keep looking straight ahead,

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:04.990
no matter how much you're tortured.

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:08.440
So, Keith Claes...

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:12.970
I've decided to make you a test subject.

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:16.010
A test subject?

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:18.880
Yes, for dark magic.

00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:22.510
I've wanted to try it for so long,

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:26.040
but I couldn't because I knew 
it would break my test subject.

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:29.440
But since you have such a strong will,

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:31.240
you should be perfect.

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:34.640
When I say "break," I don't mean physically.

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:36.960
It would only break your spirit.

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:40.460
Your beautiful body will remain unchanged.

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:42.440
You don't need to worry.

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:50.220
<i>No! I can't let myself die yet!</i>

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:52.620
<i>There are things I need to do!</i>

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:02.570
<i>I have to go back... to...</i>

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:06.930
<i>the one... I love...</i>

00:13:08.940 --> 00:13:11.050
Fight it with all your might.

00:13:12.530 --> 00:13:16.530
That will make the end result even stronger.

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:20.010
Catarina!

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:31.550
<i>I thought I heard someone screaming...</i>

00:13:34.170 --> 00:13:36.940
<i>Maybe I'll take a walk to clear my head.</i>

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:45.310
It feels so nice and cool.

00:13:45.310 --> 00:13:46.440
Catarina.

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:49.050
Prince Geordo. Good morning.

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:51.380
What happened to your hair?

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:52.010
Huh?

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:56.340
These are stuck all over your head.

00:13:58.430 --> 00:14:01.560
<i>That bear must've done it 
while I was asleep!</i>

00:14:01.560 --> 00:14:04.110
<i>He got me!</i>

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:06.660
There. I got them all.

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:08.660
Thank you.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:10.240
You're welcome.

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:13.450
Anyway, what are you 
doing out here so early?

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:17.990
Oh... Actually, I had 
a scary dream that woke me up.

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:19.390
A scary dream?

00:14:19.390 --> 00:14:22.460
Yes. I don't remember it very clearly,

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:25.040
but it made me feel so uneasy.

00:14:27.310 --> 00:14:30.680
I consider him nothing but trouble,

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:33.510
but he is a precious family member to you.

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:38.860
To be honest, I had planned to try 
to get closer to you on this trip,

00:14:38.860 --> 00:14:41.420
but I suppose I'll control myself this time.

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:44.090
Besides, after you'd finally 
become more aware of me,

00:14:44.090 --> 00:14:46.820
you seem to have forgotten already.

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:48.900
I'll leave it at this for now.

00:14:57.670 --> 00:15:00.020
Well, good morning.

00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:01.420
Good morning, Sora.

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:05.520
Sora... I really think you could 
let me get away with this much.

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:06.720
Just doing my job.

00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:09.340
I have a feeling it's more than just that.

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:11.300
Oh, no, certainly not.

00:15:19.070 --> 00:15:22.140
We'll search for Keith here in Noir today.

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:25.980
This town looks a bit different 
from the places we've seen so far.

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:27.050
Yes...

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:30.080
Would Keith really be in a place like this?

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:35.130
Lady Larna, I'll go talk to a friend 
of mine who lives in this town.

00:15:35.130 --> 00:15:36.010
A friend?

00:15:36.010 --> 00:15:39.420
Yes. I might be able to 
get some information.

00:15:39.420 --> 00:15:41.400
All right. We'll join up later.

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:42.250
Right.

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:46.490
Catarina, make sure you 
don't go anywhere by yourself.

00:15:46.490 --> 00:15:47.410
Okay.

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:53.400
All right, let's split up 
into two groups and start searching.

00:15:53.400 --> 00:15:56.590
Today, I'll go with Maria, 
and Catarina will go with Sora.

00:15:56.590 --> 00:15:57.240
Okay.

00:15:57.240 --> 00:15:58.920
I'm with Lady Catarina?

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:00.650
Is there a problem with that?

00:16:00.650 --> 00:16:03.420
No, of course not.

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:05.200
Glad to work with you, Sora!

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:19.210
I never thought I'd really 
get to go on a journey with you.

00:16:19.710 --> 00:16:22.170
And it's all thanks to this, I guess.

00:16:23.470 --> 00:16:25.180
You kept that?

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:26.740
Of course I did.

00:16:26.740 --> 00:16:30.220
It's a special stone that holds 
the colors of both your eyes and mine.

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:32.920
I'll always take good care of it.

00:16:33.980 --> 00:16:36.760
You really do look better like this

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:39.770
than when you're trying to act proper.

00:16:45.740 --> 00:16:48.520
You really are unbeatable, you know that?

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:51.330
Why must you beguile me like that?

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:53.980
<i>Beguile?</i>

00:16:53.980 --> 00:16:57.090
<i>Beguile... ba-guile...</i>

00:16:57.090 --> 00:16:58.950
<i>Bagel?!</i>

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:01.460
And at the same time, you're so defenseless.

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:04.820
It's no wonder Prince Geordo worries so much.

00:17:04.820 --> 00:17:08.110
Wait, wait! Forget about bagels! 
We're looking for Keith!

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:10.300
Bagels?

00:17:16.350 --> 00:17:19.630
Straight up that way 
is the national border of Lesabre.

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:20.660
A national border!

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:24.890
So that way leads 
to a different country? Wow!

00:17:25.090 --> 00:17:28.030
Lesabre is an absolutely lawless place.

00:17:28.030 --> 00:17:31.480
There's a lot of crime, and human 
trafficking is a thriving business.

00:17:32.250 --> 00:17:34.150
Human trafficking?

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:37.110
It's not that unusual in other countries.

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:40.080
I mean, I was trafficked myself.

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:42.010
I forgot about that...

00:17:42.010 --> 00:17:45.680
I always longed to visit other countries 
without knowing what they were like.

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:48.080
I'm kind of embarrassed.

00:17:48.640 --> 00:17:51.310
You're such an honest person.

00:17:51.310 --> 00:17:53.290
It's not a problem, though.

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:56.260
Whatever you don't know, 
you just need to learn.

00:17:57.390 --> 00:18:00.970
Whatever I don't know,
I just need to learn...

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:03.570
Yeah. You're right!

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:12.090
Unfortunately, we couldn't 
find any information.

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:13.850
Neither could we.

00:18:13.850 --> 00:18:16.910
I didn't learn anything particularly useful.

00:18:30.350 --> 00:18:32.810
Maria? What's wrong?

00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:37.840
D-Dark magic...

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:39.260
Maria! Where are they?!

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:41.840
D-Down that alley...

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:56.580
Maria, are you okay? 
You're white as a ghost.

00:18:56.580 --> 00:18:58.680
How do I even describe it?

00:18:58.680 --> 00:19:03.500
That wasn't like any dark 
magic I've sensed before.

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:07.150
It was so eerie... and terrifying.

00:19:10.480 --> 00:19:11.690
Are you calmer now?

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:14.040
Yes.

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:17.720
<i>I often did this for Keith 
when we were kids, too.</i>

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:21.150
<i>When he'd had a scary 
dream, I'd hold his hand,</i>

00:19:21.150 --> 00:19:23.150
<i>and we'd get into bed together.</i>

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:26.190
Keith's mother?

00:19:26.190 --> 00:19:27.270
<i>Yes.</i>

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:29.270
<i>According to what Prince Jeffrey found out,</i>

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:31.150
<i>on the day Keith Claes disappeared,</i>

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:34.180
<i>he had been in contact 
with his birth mother.</i>

00:19:34.180 --> 00:19:37.300
So is Keith with his mother now?

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:38.760
<i>No, he isn't.</i>

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:40.030
What does that mean?

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:43.950
Alexander?

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:56.960
There's something I need to tell all of you.

00:19:56.960 --> 00:20:00.180
I received a report from Raphael 
at the Department of Magic.

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:03.510
Keith didn't run away from home.

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:06.420
The day he disappeared,

00:20:06.420 --> 00:20:09.390
he had been contacted by his mother, 
whom he hadn't seen in years.

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:14.360
He was then taken away 
and handed over to someone else.

00:20:14.360 --> 00:20:15.950
What does this mean?

00:20:15.950 --> 00:20:19.100
He was handed over? To whom?

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:21.500
His mother doesn't remember anything.

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:23.400
It seems...

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:27.040
she was being manipulated by dark magic.

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:29.630
Wait a moment! That means...

00:20:30.240 --> 00:20:33.340
Keith Claes was kidnapped.

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:38.140
Kidnapped?

00:20:38.930 --> 00:20:43.710
The Department of Magic actually 
received intel a few weeks ago

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:46.060
concerning someone with dark magic.

00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:48.720
I had been looking into that all this time,

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:52.810
and that's when I learned 
of the disappearance of Keith Claes.

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:57.230
I find it hard to believe these 
two things aren't connected,

00:20:57.460 --> 00:21:00.190
so I had Raphael look into it, as well.

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:05.450
When I looked at his results 
alongside what we witnessed here...

00:21:06.090 --> 00:21:08.330
Then the one I saw earlier...

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:12.240
That was most likely the one 
who kidnapped Keith Claes.

00:21:14.590 --> 00:21:17.900
Just who is the kidnapper?

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:20.220
I don't know that yet.

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:22.700
I just can't seem to get a fix on them.

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:27.680
Um, uh... Then where is Keith now?

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:31.680
Alexander pointed to a mansion 
on the outskirts of town.

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:34.100
We'll go there first thing in the morning.

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:36.390
Everyone, make sure you're ready.

00:21:38.850 --> 00:21:42.150
<i>Dark magic... Kidnapped...</i>

00:21:42.150 --> 00:21:45.070
<i>I don't understand what's going on.</i>

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:48.490
<i>Keith, please be okay...</i>

00:22:32.950 --> 00:22:33.620
<b>Secret Catarina</b>

00:22:39.790 --> 00:22:40.460
<b>Secret Catarina</b>

00:22:48.170 --> 00:22:48.840
<b>Secret Catarina</b>

00:22:55.140 --> 00:22:55.810
<b>Secret Catarina</b>
